## Intent

Move the checkout from `~/.claude` to `~/.idh` in a quiet window. Keep Claude
Code's native state at `~/.claude`, with links to the harness entries it reads.
The short procedure is `docs/idh-cutover-checklist.md`.

## Done when

- [ ] Snapshot verified; checkout, native state, memory links and path-keyed
      project entries moved; Git worktrees repaired.
- [ ] The prepared wiring passes `idh check` and `make check`; fresh Claude,
      Codex and Pi launches find their harness pieces. Codex `/hooks` re-trusted
      and the dirty-reset guard probed.
- [ ] Timers restored; second host updated or its deferral recorded; tracker
      0978 and STATE reflect the observed result.
